// Float division and the unary operators the VM has instructions for are
// instructions too, with one operand for the unary ones: `DivFloat`, `NegInt`,
// `NegFloat` and `Not` read the parameters in r0 to r3 and write the tuple's
// elements to r4 to r7.
// compile: stdlib
fn f(x: Float, y: Float, a: Int, p: Bool) { (x / y, -a, -x, !p) }
